9,Austronesian languages - Academic Kids,https://academickids.com/encyclopedia/index.php/Austronesian_languages,"Mangaabe-Mbula · Paiwan · Bantik · It is theorized by some linguists that Japanese is either a member of or has been heavily influenced by the Austronesian language family. The internal structure of the Austronesian languages is difficult to work out, as the family consists of many very similar languages with large numbers of Dialect continuums.",Mbula,Austronesian
